<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/images/favicon.ico">
    <title>Artistry | <%=title%></title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="stylesabout.css">

    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playwrite+VN:wght@100..400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:ital,wght@0,100;0,200;0,300;0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;0,800;0,900;1,100;1,200;1,300;1,400;1,500;1,600;1,700;1,800;1,900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body>

    <!-- Navigation Bar -->
    <div class="menubar">
        <img class="logo" src="images/Logo.png" alt="Artistry Logo">
        <nav class="list">
            <ol>
                <li><a class="HOME" href="homepage">HOME</a></li>
                <li><a class="HOME" href="about">ABOUT US</a></li>
                <li><a class="HOME" href="contact">CONTACT</a></li>
            </ol>
        </nav>
    </div>

    <!-- About Us Section -->
    <section class="about-us">
        <div class="container">
            <h1>About Artistry</h1>
            <p>Welcome to Artistry, an online social media platform where artists can showcase their creativity, connect with others, and even sell their art pieces. Our mission is to form a strong art community and provide artists with the opportunity to earn a living from their talents. Whether you’re a painter, sculptor, photographer, or digital artist, Artistry is the platform for you.</p>

            <h2>Our Mission</h2>
            <p>Our mission at Artistry is to provide a platform that enables artists to showcase their talents and create a revenue stream through the sale of their art. We aim to empower artists worldwide by connecting them with an audience that appreciates and supports their work.</p>

            <h2>Our Values</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>Innovation</li>
                <li>Integrity</li>
                <li>Quality</li>
                <li>Sustainability</li>
                <li>Customer-Centric</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>How We Make a Difference</h2>
            <p>At Artistry, we provide a platform for artists to showcase their work and reach a global audience. Through the sale of their art pieces, artists can generate revenue, while buyers get the chance to own unique, original artworks. We foster a community where creativity thrives, and artists can make a living from their passion.</p>

            <h2>Contact Us</h2>
            <p>If you have any questions, would like to get in touch with us, or have press inquiries, please reach out to us at <a href="mailto:artistry@gmail.com">artistry@gmail.com</a>.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Footer Section -->
    <footer>
        <div class="footer-container">
            <p>&copy; 2025 Artistry. All Rights Reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
